("Data on your device","Jobs, customers, addresses, phone numbers, notes, checklists, issues, schedules, estimates, payments, costs, photos, PDF reports and backups are stored on your device. Camera and photo access is used only when you choose it."),
("Account and server data","Apple or Google sign-in sends your account identifier and email, when provided, to Supabase. Online publishing stores report identifiers, file and content hashes, status and quota records. If you turn on cloud sync (paid plans), your job records (including customer names, addresses, notes, amounts) and photos are stored in your private area on our Supabase server and are readable only by you. If you join a team, members of that team can read shared jobs, photos, comments and an activity log, and see member email addresses. If you create a customer share link, anyone holding that link can view a summary of that job (never phone numbers or internal notes) and its photos until the link expires or you revoke it; photos a customer sends through the link are stored in your private area until you import them."),
